        <body>
            <div xml:id="d877">

                <pb facs="0855" n="541" xml:id="pg541"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 867.711/2</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Turkey</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Morgenthau</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <dateline>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Embassy</hi>, <lb/>
                    <placeName>
                        <hi rendition="#italic">Constantinople</hi></placeName>, <date
                        calendar="gregorian" when="1914-11-12">
                        <hi rendition="#italic">November 12, 1914</hi>.</date>
                    <lb/> [<hi rendition="#italic">Received November 16, 9:30 a.m.</hi>] </dateline>
                <p rendition="#center">[Telegram]</p>
                <p>22. Your telegram 15, 10th. Have made arrangements with Minister of War that he
                    will forward our correspondence in sealed envelopes to all consuls and will also
                    arrange for consuls to send sealed envelopes to us.</p>
                <closer>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Ambassador</hi>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
